[Pedagogy audit v2 · New teaching] From Question 6 onward students must write the reason for similarity using alternate, corresponding or common angles, but no model of this wording is given. A short worked example of that written reasoning is needed before Question 6.
Worked example: Identify why the two triangles are similar.

[tikz]
